      "id": "claim_4ff18a7ce6dc40ef9855573c180271ba",
      "statement": "Before deleting a stale investigation's EFS directory, the reap-investigations Lambda uploads a best-effort backup of that directory to the audit bucket under `<cluster-id>/<investigation-id>/reaper-final-backup/`, reusing the `.config/ocm/*`/`.kube/*` exclusions and symlink-skipping behavior of the container's shutdown sync; it refuses to delete the directory if the backup fails or times out, so the backup-then-delete ordering is an invariant rather than best-effort cleanup.",
