      "id": "claim_1c4bee1757ed4d248c3a4e07c55d810d",
      "statement": "deploy/regional/variables.tf defaults log_retention_days to 7 days, but the Git-managed HCP Terraform configuration overrides it to 90 days for both staging regional workspaces (rosa-boundary-stage-regional in us-east-1 and rosa-boundary-stage-regional-us-west-2 in us-west-2), so the deployed container, create-investigation, and reap-tasks CloudWatch log groups in staging actually retain 90 days of logs, matching the separate retention_days variable's 90-day default rather than the 7-day log_retention_days default.",
